sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant L as Lead (research skill, session model)
  participant W as researcher x1-5 (Sonnet, fresh context)
  participant S as synthesizer (session model)
  participant V as verifier (Haiku/Sonnet)
  participant F as research/ files

  U->>L: brief
  L->>F: write runs/slug/PLAN.md (facets, mutually exclusive)
  L->>W: one brief per facet (objective, sources, note path, schema)
  W->>F: notes/facet.md (claim, URL, date, tool, contradictions, gaps, registry row)
  W-->>L: 10-line summary (takeaways, gaps, confidence, path)
  L->>W: at most one gap-filling round
  L->>S: paths of all notes
  S->>F: findings/topic.md in _FORMAT.md shape; drops claims without a URL
  L->>V: sample of cited claims
  V->>F: marks each claim verified / unverified
  L->>F: update findings/INDEX.md, open-questions.md
  L-->>U: result with paths and open questions
